## The notice Firefox's ConfirmationHint shows on the favorite button when a
## page is added to Favorites or removed from them.

sval-favorites-hint-added = Added to Favorites
sval-favorites-hint-removed = Removed from Favorites
sval-favorites-hint-already = Already in Favorites

## The question Sval asks before a link whose address is a script becomes a
## favorite. Cancel has focus.

sval-favorites-bookmarklet-question = This favorite runs a script on whatever page you’re viewing when you open it. Add it?
sval-favorites-bookmarklet-add = Add
